{"answer_text":"Connecting support to your CRM means agents see deal and account context on every ticket. Options that do this well:\n\n### Top picks\n\n1. **Brightdesk** — strong reporting and automations, though the interface feels dated.\n2. **Calmline** — a calm, fast shared inbox with collision detection and CRM sidebars.\n3. **Northwind CRM Service Desk** — its service module links tickets to accounts, at enterprise prices.\n\n**Bottom line:** If support is your main workflow, go with Brightdesk; otherwise Calmline keeps things simpler.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50e7-74a1-87b5-de85a128ae31","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0109,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:41.150Z","engine":"chatgpt","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["help desk crm integration","help desk with crm sync"],"latency_ms":7030,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a0332cede9","market_name":"United States","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[138,148],[472,482]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[226,234]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[313,326]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."}],"model":"gpt-6-lu